// Copy this file to Local.xcconfig (same folder), then uncomment the line below and add
// your Apple Developer team ID. Local.xcconfig is git-ignored; never commit a team ID.
//
// The team ID is the 10-character identifier shown under Membership details at
// developer.apple.com/account.
